    "1/0 AWG is the general floor for paralleling, and the paralleled conductors have to match each other in length, material, size, insulation and termination. There are narrow exceptions for specific applications, but the general rule is 1/0.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1/0 AWG is the general floor for paralleling, and the paralleled conductors have to match each other in length, material, size, insulation and termination. There are narrow exceptions for specific applications, but the general rule is 1/0."
          }
        }
      }
    },
