          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A one-family dwelling's service disconnecting means has a floor of 100 amperes regardless of what the calculation produces. So a small, all-gas house does not get a 90 ampere service, and the calculation's job in that case is to prove the minimum is enough rather than to size the service.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
