    "Accessible equipment can be approached for service or operation. Readily accessible equipment must be reachable quickly without portable ladders, removing obstacles, or using tools other than keys. A key-operated lock alone does not disqualify it; a cover requiring a screwdriver does. Accessibility of wiring methods has its own definition.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
