    "Count current-carrying conductors only. An equipment grounding conductor never counts. A neutral that carries only the unbalanced current of a balanced multiwire circuit does not count either, but a neutral on a circuit feeding nonlinear loads does. Getting the count wrong changes the factor and therefore the answer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Count current-carrying conductors only. An equipment grounding conductor never counts. A neutral that carries only the unbalanced current of a balanced multiwire circuit does not count either, but a neutral on a circuit feeding nonlinear loads does. Getting the count wrong changes the factor and therefore the answer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
