    "Cover is measured from the top of the wiring method to the finished grade, not from the bottom of the trench. Twenty-four inches is the baseline for direct burial; putting the same conductors inside rigid or intermediate metal conduit drops it to six, and a nonmetallic raceway listed for the purpose sits between them at eighteen.": {
