          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Derating, breaker sizing, conduit and box fill, grounding conductors, motor circuits, the whole dwelling service. Every one is a pure calculation, so we generate them forever instead of shipping the same fifty questions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Derating, breaker sizing, conduit and box fill, grounding conductors, motor circuits, the whole dwelling service. Every one is a pure calculation, so we generate them forever instead of shipping the same fifty questions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Derating, breaker sizing, conduit fill, box fill and voltage drop are pure calculations: same inputs, same answer, every time. That means they can be generated endlessly instead of shipped as a fixed question bank you memorise the shape of. Every wrong choice you see is the number you get from one specific, common mistake.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Derating, breaker sizing, conduit fill, box fill and voltage drop are pure calculations: same inputs, same answer, every time. That means they can be generated endlessly instead of shipped as a fixed question bank you memorise the shape of. Every wrong choice you see is the number you get from one specific, common mistake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
