    "One range not over 12 kW is 8 kW, whatever the nameplate says: 8.5, 10 and 12 kW ranges all come in at 8. Above 12 kW the column C figure rises 5% for each kilowatt, or major fraction of one, over 12. The nameplate is almost never the number, which is the same lesson Article 430 teaches about motors.": {
