            "value": "These are the areas that move between editions, and none of them is a table this app computes from. Every one of them is taught here as a rule to confirm in the book your jurisdiction has adopted, never as a number to memorise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These requirements can also change between editions. Confirm their scope, exceptions and local amendments in the book named by your exam board.": {
