        }
      }
    },
    "You bring the code book in with you. That sounds like relief and it is actually the whole difficulty: the exam is timed, and a question you have to hunt for costs you two more you never reach. What is being tested is navigation speed, not memory.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
