    "You sized from the nameplate current. Branch-circuit conductors come off the full-load current in Table 430.248 or 430.250, whatever the nameplate says. The nameplate is only used for the overload device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
