    "You used another device's percentage. For these ordinary motors, Table 430.52(C)(1) uses 300% for nontime-delay fuses, 175% for dual-element fuses other than Class CC, and 250% for inverse-time breakers. Instantaneous-trip settings require the applicable motor design and listed combination controller.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
